{"3735030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Evergreen Tavern", "steam_appid": 3735030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4768510], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evergreen Tavern is a fresh take on the cozy medieval tavern sim genre. Run your tavern and live your life with farming, fishing, cooking, decorating, brewing... while hidden systems reward harmony with nature. Explore ever-changing dungeons below to befriend monsters who can join your staff. Create a living, magical ecosystem unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ffb8223df5816bc2efb5cb9c045d266d.poster.avif?t=1781186464\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ffb8223df5816bc2efb5cb9c045d266d.webm?t=1781186464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ffb8223df5816bc2efb5cb9c045d266d.mp4?t=1781186464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use delicious ingredients to prepare drinks and dishes and serve them to the villagers. Make use of a detailed menu system to let them know exactly how many of which product you want to sell so you never get overwhelmed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a9e1569a9660b0d01c7a88a506d25194.poster.avif?t=1781186464\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a9e1569a9660b0d01c7a88a506d25194.webm?t=1781186464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a9e1569a9660b0d01c7a88a506d25194.mp4?t=1781186464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ever-changing dungeons, find loot to sell, and hire strange monsters as staff!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ecb45b466f8a399191b5973091293f39.poster.avif?t=1781186464\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ecb45b466f8a399191b5973091293f39.webm?t=1781186464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ecb45b466f8a399191b5973091293f39.mp4?t=1781186464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your garden so it can provide the best ingredients for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your animals shelter and a steady source of food and water, protect your crops from wildlife, use biodiversity... Everything has an impact in Evergreen Tavern's farm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/5a9576bbacc9b858d21c85635398b0aa.poster.avif?t=1781186464\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/5a9576bbacc9b858d21c85635398b0aa.webm?t=1781186464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/5a9576bbacc9b858d21c85635398b0aa.mp4?t=1781186464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide variety of decorating options to make your place your own. Decorate floors, walls, ceilings, outside and inside... Everything goes and the villagers will love you for it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find many more activities in Evergreen Tavern as the game keeps getting updated!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evergreen Tavern is a fresh take on the cozy medieval tavern sim genre. Run your tavern and live your life with farming, fishing, cooking, decorating, brewing... while hidden systems reward harmony with nature. Explore ever-changing dungeons below to befriend monsters who can join your staff. Create a living, magical ecosystem unlike any other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ffb8223df5816bc2efb5cb9c045d266d.poster.avif?t=1781186464\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ffb8223df5816bc2efb5cb9c045d266d.webm?t=1781186464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ffb8223df5816bc2efb5cb9c045d266d.mp4?t=1781186464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use delicious ingredients to prepare drinks and dishes and serve them to the villagers. Make use of a detailed menu system to let them know exactly how many of which product you want to sell so you never get overwhelmed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a9e1569a9660b0d01c7a88a506d25194.poster.avif?t=1781186464\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a9e1569a9660b0d01c7a88a506d25194.webm?t=1781186464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/a9e1569a9660b0d01c7a88a506d25194.mp4?t=1781186464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore ever-changing dungeons, find loot to sell, and hire strange monsters as staff!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ecb45b466f8a399191b5973091293f39.poster.avif?t=1781186464\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ecb45b466f8a399191b5973091293f39.webm?t=1781186464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/ecb45b466f8a399191b5973091293f39.mp4?t=1781186464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your garden so it can provide the best ingredients for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give your animals shelter and a steady source of food and water, protect your crops from wildlife, use biodiversity... Everything has an impact in Evergreen Tavern's farm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/5a9576bbacc9b858d21c85635398b0aa.poster.avif?t=1781186464\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/5a9576bbacc9b858d21c85635398b0aa.webm?t=1781186464\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/extras/5a9576bbacc9b858d21c85635398b0aa.mp4?t=1781186464\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide variety of decorating options to make your place your own. Decorate floors, walls, ceilings, outside and inside... Everything goes and the villagers will love you for it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find many more activities in Evergreen Tavern as the game keeps getting updated!</p>", "short_description": "Run a cozy medieval tavern... staffed by monsters from your basement! Grow and cook delicious things and serve them to your customers. Decorate and customize your place. Explore dark places, befriend and hire monsters, and sell your loot for a good price!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "reviews": "“Evergreen Tavern is likely to grow far beyond what it is now, and that’s perhaps even more exciting. Who knows where it will end up, but one thing is for sure: it’s definitely breaking the mold.”<br>The Nerdy Type<br><br>“Lays the groundwork for a game that truly understands that 'cozy sims' need a dash of adventure... the charm is absolutely undeniable.”<br>15/20 – Geek-o-Polis<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/4b16fbfeca2eab07fb801c92820ac41e5ca0e84f/header.jpg?t=1781186464", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/61ad6487f84b1af5e83e5b72b217ea1670050d14/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781186464", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735030/61ad6487f84b1af5e83e5b72b217ea1670050d14/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781186464", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10 or 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 7th gen or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>M